6,"Tibetan Traditional Music: Folk Song, Sacred Chant, Heritage",https://tourtraveltibet.com/tibet/music/,"The Vibrant Tapestry of Tibetan Traditional Music Tibetan traditional music is an essential element of the region's cultural identity, offering a rich and diverse expression of its heritage. This dynamic art form encompasses multiple genres, including folk, religious, and court music, each playing a vital role in preserving and celebrating Tibet's unique traditions. Among these, Tibetan ...",Koch,Sino-Tibetan
7,Songs and Music of Tibet - Smithsonian Folkways Recordings,https://folkways.si.edu/songs-and-music-of-tibet/world/album/smithsonian,"From a camp in the outskirts of Kathmandu, Howard Kaufman captures the essence of Tibetan chants. Kaufman gathers songs that are ""excerpts from much longer versions of both Eastern and Western Tibet"". While some of the songs are religious in subject, others praise the beautiful land, food, herding and other aspects of rural Tibetan life. Liner notes include a brief introduction by Kaufman ...",Koch,Sino-Tibetan
8,Music | Tenzin Choegyal,https://tenzinchoegyal.bandcamp.com/,"Tenzin Choegyal is a Tibetan artist, composer, activist, musical director, and cultural ambassador, and one of the world's finest musicians in the Tibetan tradition. Forced into exile in India as his family fled the repression in Tibet, he now resides in Australia. He channels the wisdom and traditions of his ancestors through his songs and compositions.",Koch,Sino-Tibetan
